#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello bilan taqqoslanadigan yuzingiz suratlari. Har xil yoritishda "
"yozilgan kamida ikkitasini saqlang."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Quyidagilar uchun saqlangan modellar ko'rsatilmoqda:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Faqat bitta yuz modeli roʻyxatga olingan. Yoritish sizning yuzingiz kameraga "
"qanday ko'rinishini o'zgartiradi, shuning uchun bitta model kechqurun "
"lampalar ostida (yoki kunduzi) ishlamay qolishi mumkin. Kunning istalgan "
"vaqtida ishonchli qulfni ochish uchun boshqa yorug'likda yozilgan ikkinchi "
"modelni qo'shing."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ikkinchi modelni qo'shing"

