msgstr "Bildirishnoma tovushlari"

#: src/main.ui:509
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Taniqli yoki muvaffaqiyatsiz urinish uchun tizim ovozini o'ynang."

#: src/main.ui:540
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostikani o'z ichiga oladi"

#: src/main.ui:546
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Har bir kartaga model, aniqlik va chegara, ramkalar, kamera va vaqtni "
"qo'shing. Muammo haqida xabar berishda foydalidir."

#: src/main.ui:610 src/onboarding.ui:707
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Kalitlar / KWallet Avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish"

#: src/main.ui:624
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kirish kalitini avtomatik ravishda ochish uchun yuz autentifikatsiyasini "
"yoqing yoki tizimga kirishda KWallet. Bu mavjud bo'lganda TPM da muhrlangan "
"yoki faqat ildiz kaliti yordamida AES-256-GCM bilan shifrlangan parolingizni "
"xavfsiz saqlaydi. Ish stolingizga qarab pam_gnome_keyring yoki pam_kwallet5 "
"uchun yuzni autentifikatsiya qilish PAM_AUTHTOK oʻrnatiladi."

